  },
  "limitations": [
    "These are development examples,not full-set scores or held-out transfer validation.",
    "Only69 of110 scan poses satisfy the conservative outer-strip registration gates. All41 rejected rows remain visible,diagnostic and excluded from means. Do not certify scan geometry from affine stretch.",
    "Existing gold assets are retained when Fourth has no donor. Historical glyph eras and current target-set mana paper/ink are retained;layout values alone are tested separately.",
    "Rules are provider Original text and have not received a complete scan-wording audit. Type lines were independently checked. Copyright strings preserve current output and are not certified against these printings.",
    "No inherited old-frame API or replacement mid/late default has been published. The through-Fourth objective remains active."
